	<meta name="description" content="Aaron Oberst’s acting career boomed when he joined the vertical short drama industry in the year 2023. This American actor, screenwriter and producer is well-known for his lead roles in several mini-series like Pucked and Pregnant (2025) and Daddy December (2024). His passion for acting drives him to reach his ideals in life." />
